--- !u!114 &1659062076
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1659062065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 31c5ce66a347b1d4a9cd6527859d6f43, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VoiceGame.Narrator
  lines:
  - id: menu_welcome
    text: Welcome to Sentinel. Choose how you want to play.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5711832b2203d474ea669562d0e8d89b, type: 3}
  - id: menu_option1
    text: Option one, Voice Control. You watch the screen and command the hero with your voice. This is for players who cannot use a keyboard or controller.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0a71ca5c9d04254cb9d1f2d901d97fa, type: 3}
  - id: menu_option2
    text: Option two, Audio Game. Everything is told through sound, so you can play without seeing the screen. This is for blind players.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6af9f9f89ce85154abf549e03ef1f811, type: 3}
  - id: menu_option3
    text: Option three, Settings. Change the volume.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c13dc33ad346c3841b15c726a29316ac, type: 3}
  - id: menu_how
    text: Say one, two, or three. Or press the one, two, or three key.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 141d08d4e5ad78c4e8f4cbd99372d3a4, type: 3}
  - id: menu_start1
    text: Starting Voice Control.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03f19e725a7d91e4185e3dc54b8c0a81, type: 3}
  - id: menu_start2
    text: Starting the Audio Game.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a2ea3fd8d2b849469657f300863daa6, type: 3}
  - id: menu_unclear
    text: Sorry, I did not catch that. Say one, two, three, or repeat.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 458e653f03cc708468b3d370fb44492b, type: 3}
  - id: settings_title
    text: You are in settings.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 072f1c85186b27944b1e3c6f2902e623, type: 3}
  - id: settings_back_how
    text: Say back to return to the menu.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5494fc135717c074694d6f9a743c3f20, type: 3}
  - id: settings_unclear
    text: Sorry, I did not catch that. Say louder, quieter, or back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e8035b076fabc54d8bbf066f35da539, type: 3}
  - id: volume_how
    text: To change the volume, say louder or quieter, or press the up and down arrow keys. You can also say a number, like volume fifty.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b4a17bf0b0ec19a4bbfcaf23b909bb8d, type: 3}
  - id: volume_max
    text: That is the loudest setting.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bb0c1d4a8053384eb4a37f8ab4f7d31, type: 3}
  - id: volume_min
    text: That is the quietest setting.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d74ff37a9a897f449a6c0ec33f7e4e57, type: 3}
  - id: volume_10
    text: Volume ten percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92dc62594551d554984f39b7011498b6, type: 3}
  - id: volume_20
    text: Volume twenty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e19e0e8baa38e54e81ee047989713e1, type: 3}
  - id: volume_30
    text: Volume thirty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc764fc80cbf3234e96d983bbc959df1, type: 3}
  - id: volume_40
    text: Volume forty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 07c75065e62783b45b49d9f7b5ee02aa, type: 3}
  - id: volume_50
    text: Volume fifty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ce3793e689b2914089419ca6cec7a03, type: 3}
  - id: volume_60
    text: Volume sixty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36edacca56849334f80e4b5dfa8a2dad, type: 3}
  - id: volume_70
    text: Volume seventy percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 79fec8831eb06214493c1b45c25fa396, type: 3}
  - id: volume_80
    text: Volume eighty percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c932b394600f3c4a9cb60f0b75510f7, type: 3}
  - id: volume_90
    text: Volume ninety percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de4581b89798a6749b1ca555b02ea7fc, type: 3}
  - id: volume_100
    text: Volume one hundred percent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 690057c7eedf7314c9878d0887b0670b, type: 3}
  - id: intro_welcome
    text: Welcome to the Audio Game. You do not need the screen. Everything you need will be spoken or played as a sound. To skip this introduction, hold the space bar and say skip.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16b70ecf92f9afb4ea584f4dbddcd12e, type: 3}
  - id: intro_talk
    text: Here is how to talk to your hero. Hold down the space bar, say a command, then let go. You will hear this sound when the game starts listening.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0dc47cd405814dd43a7a3f62d0966f5f, type: 3}
  - id: intro_talk_off
    text: And this sound when it stops listening.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4296cd605afc034195f0aca1d8681ca, type: 3}
  - id: intro_mic
    text: If the game does not hear you, press the M key to try another microphone.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a751684f9a16b4441bb5aa61b5bb86db, type: 3}
  - id: intro_goal
    text: You are trapped in a courtyard, and you must escape. First, go to the chest, and jump to grab the key floating above it. Then go to the gate to get out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca4a33065cf6240498515b87bba4632e, type: 3}
  - id: intro_places
    text: There are four places you can name. The chest, the tower, the bridge, and the gate. You never need to steer. Name a place, and the hero finds the way.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e8b0e228072d9d4aacbc4a07c4eaa71, type: 3}
  - id: intro_moves
    text: To move, say run to, or walk to, and then a place. For example, run to the chest. Running is fast, and walking is slow. You can also join commands, like, run to the chest and jump.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a2e1a73fb8bdbd46b807e3765656fa2, type: 3}
  - id: intro_actions
    text: You can also say jump, stop, crouch, and stand up.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e80af92286546194dad0ade7a0698e59, type: 3}
  - id: intro_eye
    text: A giant eye called the Sentinel sits on top of the tower. If it sees you moving while it is open, you go back to the start and lose a life. You have three lives.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 004c351cc7e8ee14ba89e0f20748445d, type: 3}
  - id: intro_crouch
    text: The eye cannot see you while you crouch, even when you move, but crouching is slow. Say crouch, then walk to a place. Running makes you stand up again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b5e1b7432d89f24b8e677cb8574295c, type: 3}
  - id: intro_tower
    text: If you reach the tower, you jam the eye, and it goes blind for fifteen seconds. This only works once each round.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7e0ad38abeb50241acb40fe8133a4b2, type: 3}
  - id: cues_intro
    text: Now learn the three sounds of the eye. Green, yellow, and red. One of these sounds plays all through the game, so you always know if it is safe to move.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed2449f7c01de2248a2b107fd6236f35, type: 3}
  - id: cue_green
    text: Green means the eye is asleep. You are safe to move. Green sounds like this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d41d8538754e62c42a9601933e1cc760, type: 3}
  - id: cue_yellow
    text: Yellow means the eye is opening. You have about two seconds. Say stop, or say crouch. Yellow sounds like this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6aa4d77b0f026a7459f43100a0737a50, type: 3}
  - id: cue_red
    text: Red means the eye is watching. Do not move until the sound changes. Red sounds like this.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 341b412a423cd1d45994563ba77ced85, type: 3}
  - id: cues_review
    text: Let's review.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f4f84b853032904c9b2125b72be6562, type: 3}
  - id: review_green
    text: Green. It is safe to move.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a24b2088300a3444bafd92277b01991, type: 3}
  - id: review_yellow
    text: Yellow. Say stop.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3be13a58742c6a945b415b46f20667a2, type: 3}
  - id: review_red
    text: Red. Do not move.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5f309a9fd0a9b24cb2b6b2b44f8dce6, type: 3}
  - id: intro_meta
    text: During the game, say help to hear the rules, sounds to hear these sounds again, where am I to hear where you are, or menu to go back to the main menu. To change the volume, say louder or quieter, or press the up and down arrow keys.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e27d2b455efbe2940bf47f6a14242bf6, type: 3}
  - id: intro_ready
    text: That is everything. When you are ready, hold the space bar and say start.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48fa7d1e318199746b0732a51ea10b59, type: 3}
  - id: waiting_hint
    text: Hold the space bar and say start when you are ready.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f1e34d6ff67b084998fa63a41b14ab8, type: 3}
  - id: game_go
    text: The game has begun. Your first goal is the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66f615726dd5d2f4f87acc71a91ac272, type: 3}
  - id: restart
    text: Starting again. Your first goal is the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6c5b6801d913b4147b4f5ab8f70ec264, type: 3}
  - id: back_to_game
    text: Back to the game.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffddb6324d1064c4e8b719205e667a56, type: 3}
  - id: run_chest
    text: Running to the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c6d91bbb5e7799d40b34d948cad3f2fd, type: 3}
  - id: run_tower
    text: Running to the tower.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c11243b54ff24284eb18ddb91ee5178c, type: 3}
  - id: run_bridge
    text: Running to the bridge.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2898bd5de2ddb6143a3898510e82b8ae, type: 3}
  - id: run_gate
    text: Running to the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 05b4dc6c51e38f9479132ebe6c3234de, type: 3}
  - id: walk_chest
    text: Walking to the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68082d33435138642a5cba6f91c7dfc6, type: 3}
  - id: walk_tower
    text: Walking to the tower.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcf5cd1185ede50488034d2578f5709d, type: 3}
  - id: walk_bridge
    text: Walking to the bridge.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5f23ce15d8fe7145a92c5185e66c753, type: 3}
  - id: walk_gate
    text: Walking to the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da4ace6d25f57ab46bcf821a58cf1472, type: 3}
  - id: stopping
    text: Stopping.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85e5a589e365be84a981126b3589b255, type: 3}
  - id: crouching
    text: Crouching. The eye cannot see you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 423dcdfbb95fc1145a193684a774de6b, type: 3}
  - id: standing
    text: Standing up.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31a2e9122fc36904097179f63cba1e1e, type: 3}
  - id: arrive_chest_nokey
    text: You are at the chest. Say jump to grab the key.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c90cfcc3d71f9640b6b070659b54d64, type: 3}
  - id: arrive_chest
    text: You are at the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e97f4d944edb0547a1a9851ffe3f5b1, type: 3}
  - id: arrive_tower
    text: You are at the tower.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 960f901bca3a2124693d83104ccca116, type: 3}
  - id: arrive_bridge
    text: You are on the bridge.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 424c4206b12a0d446a71bce7ce128477, type: 3}
  - id: arrive_gate_locked
    text: You are at the gate, but it is locked. You need the key from the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5524409fde783344bdbe58c18e9d61a, type: 3}
  - id: key_got
    text: You grabbed the key! Now go to the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f68dc20cef56ccd44a821f50387ab06e, type: 3}
  - id: jammed
    text: You jammed the eye! It is blind for fifteen seconds. Move now.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89a159daec1eb9947bb01536e50f83de, type: 3}
  - id: jam_over
    text: The eye is working again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0de04277007de4c45bbb0120dc5090d8, type: 3}
  - id: seen_2
    text: You were seen! Back to the start. Two lives left.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd1d941bdc9d9434fb2a28e4984101e3, type: 3}
  - id: seen_1
    text: You were seen! Back to the start. One life left.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 11ae07942a39a1547a5b6af5026884ef, type: 3}
  - id: won
    text: You opened the gate and escaped! You win! Say restart to play again, or menu to choose another game.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01ea52a7dbd6eec4497c2fc105e15c9d, type: 3}
  - id: lost
    text: The Sentinel caught you. Game over. Say restart to try again, or menu to choose another game.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 970464b7b2d56b24cac087eedca451a3, type: 3}
  - id: say_restart
    text: The round is over. Say restart, or say menu.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ffc9f108041976498fb56896029ecc3, type: 3}
  - id: didnt_catch
    text: Sorry, I did not catch that.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74bd50d2d95fdfb4698bbc09d8166405, type: 3}
  - id: not_command
    text: That is not a command. Say help to hear the rules.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 534ca9bf531d9d748a87c13567bff81f, type: 3}
  - id: near_start
    text: You are near the start.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b664c773fcceda4dbfcc7acf6b5ddf5, type: 3}
  - id: near_chest
    text: You are near the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72e846f9d973df547904eee8d79cdba2, type: 3}
  - id: near_tower
    text: You are near the tower.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cafee414192a438429e5637f789ef8de, type: 3}
  - id: near_bridge
    text: You are near the bridge.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dcb1fb393f0b22a4b8a1c2f050090f49, type: 3}
  - id: near_gate
    text: You are near the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f70c3aea910a7dc44bbacfddb7db6c67, type: 3}
  - id: status_key_yes
    text: You have the key. Go to the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a4a1fcc563ab5e449ed79da82a873f7, type: 3}
  - id: status_key_no
    text: You still need the key from the chest.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1be8fc728c67e9a48a34ab660ad64ce6, type: 3}
  - id: status_lives_3
    text: You have three lives.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ea314154b578df488d887981f107aef, type: 3}
  - id: status_lives_2
    text: You have two lives.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eabed3ee74c373c4abf812c5aa86389e, type: 3}
  - id: status_lives_1
    text: You have one life.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 237197c7ba96ad842a2fe5a84b01ce16, type: 3}
  - id: going_to_menu
    text: Going back to the menu.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0aa3676b85464cb41a696b769ca989aa, type: 3}
  - id: no_mic
    text: No microphone was found. Connect a microphone and start the game again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82705790c86d4274790c0cf922a6eb94, type: 3}
  - id: mic_changed
    text: Microphone changed. Hold the space bar and try speaking.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e45f885a3c31de04885d4534775723b1, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 1970460206}
